>>
Rule 10 (output tensor matches input's shape apart from the dim)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) = shape(v_2)
>>
Rule 11 (prepend and append have equal shape except dimension dim)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor, v_4 : int} |= shape(v_1, v_4) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, v_4) = shape(v_3, 0)
